text = "BAKED ILLUSTRATED TERRAIN - all 94 configurations / A-B-C solid interiors"

[node name="Instructions" type="Label" parent="."]
offset_left = 32.0
offset_top = 52.0
text = "Select PaintingWorkspace > TileMap > Terrains > Connect. Paint Earth or Green.\n128-unit cells; zoom out. Fill a broad background, then paint the other terrain over it.\nAll 94 configurations are illustrated. Four extra solid tiles supply approved B/C alternatives.\nCheck horizontal and vertical boundaries, both endpoints, corners, narrow links and islands.\nRepeat with reversed paint order. No F5/F6 needed. Record selected source/cell and brush order."

